3a:["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0 max-w-[720px] px-6 pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted","children":"Accuracy is measured on your own data, not on a public benchmark. Every model, prompt and rule change runs against gold sets before it reaches you. No decision type runs unattended until its measured accuracy clears a threshold your qualified person has approved in writing, and if accuracy drops below that threshold the decision returns to people automatically. Every decision is recorded with the versions that produced it, so any case can be replayed."}]
3b:["$","li","What happens to our data?",{"children":["$","details",null,{"className":"group rounded-card border border-line bg-surface open:border-strong","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-[17px] font-semibold text-primary [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What happens to our data?",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45 motion-reduce:transition-none","children":["$","svg",null,{"width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M12 5v14M5 12h14"}]}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0 max-w-[720px] px-6 pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted","children":"It is processed and stored in India, encrypted in transit and at rest, and isolated in your own tenant. We do not train models on it, and model providers are used under zero-retention terms. You can ask for your data to be deleted at any point, including after a benchmark. Access is logged in the same audit trail as everything else."}]]}]}]
3c:["$","li","What if the benchmark makes us look bad?",{"children":["$","details",null,{"className":"group rounded-card border border-line bg-surface open:border-strong","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-[17px] font-semibold text-primary [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What if the benchmark makes us look bad?",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45 motion-reduce:transition-none","children":["$","svg",null,{"width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M12 5v14M5 12h14"}]}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0 max-w-[720px] px-6 pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted","children":"The report is yours either way, and it is yours alone — we do not use your results as a reference or a case study without a separate written agreement. If the benchmark shows your current process is already ahead, we will tell you that."}]]}]}]
3d:["$","li","Do we have to replace our safety database?",{"children":["$","details",null,{"className":"group rounded-card border border-line bg-surface open:border-strong","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-[17px] font-semibold text-primary [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Do we have to replace our safety database?",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45 motion-reduce:transition-none","children":["$","svg",null,{"width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M12 5v14M5 12h14"}]}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0 max-w-[720px] px-6 pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted","children":"No. Vyom Audit works against whatever system you already run. For case processing we produce E2B(R3) output, and connection to existing safety databases is on the roadmap for Vyom OS."}]]}]}]
